<!-- ABOUT -->
<section id="about">
  <div class="section-tag">About Me</div>
  <div class="about-grid">
    <div class="about-text">
      <h2 class="section-title">Engineer by training,<br><em style="font-family:var(--display);font-style:italic">problem-solver</em> by nature.</h2>
      <p>I'm a final-year Computer Science student at <strong>Jerusalem College of Engineering</strong>, Chennai, graduating in March 2026 with a CGPA of 8.5. I specialise in Java full-stack development — from designing normalised database schemas and securing APIs to building responsive frontends.</p>
      <p>During my internship, I independently built a full <strong>Task Management System</strong> using Spring Boot and MySQL, complete with JWT authentication, role-based access control, and Cloudinary integration. I care deeply about clean architecture, robust error handling, and APIs that just work.</p>
      <p>Outside of code, I've explored IoT with a <strong>sign language glove</strong> prototype — bridging hardware and software to help speech- and hearing-impaired users communicate in real time.</p>
