      <li>Developed RESTful APIs for task, project, and issue management modules with full CRUD operations.</li>
      <li>Implemented JWT-based authentication and Role-Based Access Control (RBAC) to enforce endpoint security.</li>
      <li>Designed workflow-based status transitions to streamline task tracking and project progress management.</li>
      <li>Integrated Cloudinary for efficient file upload and media storage, handling edge cases and large payloads.</li>
      <li>Designed and managed a normalised relational database schema in MySQL for data integrity at scale.</li>
